{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Escape Game Sleepless&quot;! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Escape Game Sleepless&quot; includes below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Sleepless</strong>\u00a0<strong>***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse put the kids to bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Mouse comes to see them later, There are no kids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Hinamatsuri</strong>\u00a0<strong>***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is Hinamatsuri today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a cat is decorating, hina dolls has run away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hina dolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Mole House</strong>\u00a0<strong>***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hen and Chicks are taking a walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the Chick falls into a pitfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the mole house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Teatime</strong> <strong>***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mice are having tea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, Bear fall in front of the house and mice aren\u2019t unable to get out of the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the house and save the fallen bear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Flower</strong>\u00a0<strong>***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Sheep is taking a walk, she finds a nice flower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a flower to give as a present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Swim Ring ***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day a bear goes to the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other bears are swiming with swim rings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a swim ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Recital ***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mole is waiting to go to the recital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But his friends does not come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go pick up friends before the bus departs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Tiny Cube ***</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Plain Room ***</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** Escape Game Statue***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a tiny room here and you are closed in there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's escape from the room! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with easy operation only with taps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 How to play </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap to find out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to use items, select the item and tap the place you want to use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To enlarge an item, tap the item twice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to combine items, enlarge the item, select the item you want to combine, and tap. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To close an enlarged item, tap the cross button. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need hints, tap the bulb button. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Function </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an auto save function. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Features </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginners can enjoy it to the last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended for those who like cute world view.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sleepless Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564660/66fd2968ab